The detail region diffraction positions of different doped samples were observed, and it was found that the characteristic diffraction peaks in the range of 31.5°～33° and 51°～52.5° had a tendency of shifting to larger diffraction angles, and its tendency was gradually more obvious as CaF2 and CuO addition increasing. According to the Bragg equation (
